---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { site } from '../site.config';
const plausible = Boolean(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_DOMAIN && import.meta.env.PUBLIC_PLAUSIBLE_SCRIPT_URL);
const umami = !plausible && Boolean(import.meta.env.PUBLIC_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID && import.meta.env.PUBLIC_UMAMI_SCRIPT_URL);
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How this static website handles search, newsletter subscriptions, optional analytics, and external links.">
  <div class="container narrow section">
    <header class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">Your privacy</p><h1>Room to read quietly.</h1><p>This page describes how the current website works. Last updated 6 November 2026.</p></header>
    <div class="prose">
      <p class="callout">This is a draft privacy notice. The site owner, contact details, hosting arrangements, and any configured providers need human and legal review before public launch.</p>
      <h2>Reading and searching</h2><p>You do not need an account to read this website. We do not provide comments, a member profile, or a database for reader submissions. Search runs in your browser using a downloaded Pagefind index. Search terms are not sent to an external search service.</p>
      <h2>Hosting and technical information</h2><p>The hosting provider may process technical information such as your IP address, request time, and requested page to deliver the website and protect its service. The owner must confirm the provider, retention settings, and applicable privacy terms before public launch.</p>
      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      {plausible || umami ? <p>This build has {plausible ? 'Plausible' : 'Umami'} analytics configured. It is intended to measure general website use without advertising cookies. The owner must confirm the provider settings, information collected, retention, and any consent requirements. Search and reading do not require a reader account.</p> : <p>This build has no analytics script configured. The website does not set advertising or tracking cookies as part of its own reading or search features.</p>}
      <h2>Newsletter</h2>
      {site.newsletter.action ? <p>Newsletter signup is available through a configured external provider. The form sends your email address directly to that provider. A confirmation email is required before subscription. The owner must publish the provider's name, privacy terms, and retention details and verify the confirmation flow before public launch.</p> : <p>Newsletter signup is not active in this build, so there is no newsletter form collecting your email address. If signup is enabled later, it will send your email directly to the selected provider, with a confirmation email before subscription.</p>}
      <p>When subscribed, use the unsubscribe link in a newsletter to stop receiving it. Do not include health information in newsletter fields.</p>
      <h2>External websites and media</h2><p>Reference links and support directories take you to other websites, which have their own privacy practices. Embedded YouTube players, when enabled, load from youtube-nocookie.com only after you choose to load a video. That action connects your browser to YouTube; its terms and privacy practices then apply.</p>
      <h2>Your questions and rights</h2><p>Depending on where you live and which services are enabled, you may have rights relating to personal information. The owner must add a working privacy contact and process for requests before public launch. See <a href="/contact/">contact availability</a>.</p>
      <h2>Changes</h2><p>This notice must be reviewed when hosting, signup, analytics, or media settings change. The update date at the top identifies the current draft.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
